WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.370
Standardization and correction should not be treated
as the same operation Trimming

00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:11.920
an email or changing case preserves the intended
value Mapping tech

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:19.417
to Electronics may be appropriate if the business
taxonomy explicitly defines that equivalence
Changing

00:00:19.431 --> 00:00:25.680
a negative price to a positive price makes a much
stronger claim about reality That

00:00:25.706 --> 00:00:27.470
kind of correction needs evidence
